    ],
    "title": "**`[[deep-path]]` coexistence**",
    "text": "**`[[deep-path]]` coexistence**: <a name='id/BlockNode:00CDBYV5A800D' class='aperas-anchor aperas-id'></a> not needed, at least for now — `aperas://` scheme URLs (in-app) and `#fragment`s (compatible/pre-ingestion), including an `id/<ID>` fragment form, already make an internal reference unambiguous without a `[[...]]` wrapper. See [Topology](../design/linking.md#id/BlockNode:00CDBYV4T8007).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CDBYV5A800B",
    "type": "listItem",
