    "title": "00CDC0RCCR006",
    "text": "**Every `<block-slug-path>` written so far omitted its own H1 segment.** `toPath()` (`apeironNgn/node.ts:455-471`) walks every `BlockNode` ancestor — the H1 heading included — contributing a slug segment for each, stopping only at the owning `ArtifactNode`/`FolderNode`. Every anchor and cross-reference in this concern's own docs had been computed without that leading segment (traced back to the very first `test-slugifed-path.md` validation, which never included its own H1 either) and has been corrected corpus-wide. See [Topology](../design/linking.md#id/BlockNode:00CDBYV4T8007).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CDBYV5A800B",
    "type": "listItem",
