    ],
    "title": "**Collision check only covered a block's current slug-path**",
    "text": "**Collision check only covered a block's current slug-path**: <a name='id/BlockNode:00CDBYV5A800K' class='aperas-anchor aperas-id'></a> resolved — Slice 2's collision check (`apeironNgn/node.ts`'s `rejectSlugPathCollisions`) checks every anchor `name` still embedded in a block's `treeAnchor` prop or raw text too, not just its current `toPath()`, since [Anchor-Matching Requirement for Resolution](../design/linking.md#id/BlockNode:00CDBYV4TG005) already treats either as a live resolvable target. See [Planning](../planning/linking.md#id/BlockNode:00CDBZ77F000X).",
