    "title": "### Slice 2",
    "text": "Completes the toolset needed to work directly on Apeiron day-to-day: reject a real authoring mistake at ingestion time, let a compatibility anchor actually retire once it's safe to, and cover Slice 1's own mechanism in `verify.ts`. Corpus-wide rollout — correcting non-compliant colon lead-ins and migrating old-style `[[deep-path]]` links — is a separate topic, out of scope here.",
