    "text": "Reuse the scratch-ingest methodology already used while planning this (write a throwaway artifact under a scratch subfolder of the real `AperasKG/artifacts/`, matching `verify.ts`'s own `DEMO_DIR` pattern; `rehydrateStore()` the real mirror in-memory, never dehydrated back; `trackArtifact`/`ingestFolderTree`/`ingestArtifact`; read back via `wrap()`; `rmSync` the scratch folder after). Concretely check:",
