    "@id": "BlockNode:00CDBZ77F800D",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**Task 3** (step 15)",
    "text": "**Task 3** (step 15): <a name='id/BlockNode:00CDBZ77F800D' class='aperas-anchor aperas-id'></a> deleting an anchor tag from a block's source text and re-ingesting drops it from `treeAnchor`/the graph, with no other block affected; a full-text safety search catches an old-style reference living in a file that isn't tracked/ingested, a case `kg:backlinks` alone misses.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CDBZ77F800A",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
