    "title": "**History**",
    "text": "**History**: [Planning — nothing shipped yet](../history/cli-packaging.md#id/BlockNode:00CDDVCKCG002).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CDDVBXHG001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CDDVBXHG005",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "## Architecture",
    "text": "The published CLI is a single `kg` binary that argv-dispatches to a subcommand per verb (`kg ingest`, `kg tree`, `kg unfold`, ...), reusing each command's existing `run*` function and `request()` call against the shared ApeironNgn service — only the argv-parsing/help-printing glue currently duplicated per-file collapses into one router.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CDDVBXH8001",
    "type": "heading",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CDDVC338001",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "# CLI Packaging — Discussion",
    "parent": "ArtifactNode:00CDDTBQWG000",
    "type": "heading",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00CDEZ1A68001",
      "BlockNode:00CDEM7DVG001",
