    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00CDDVC8N0004",
      "BlockNode:00CDDVC8N0005"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CDDVC8N0004",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "links": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00CDDVC8N0004:links:Link:00CDDW6ZJG000",
        "@type": "Link",
        "target": "BlockNode:00CDDVC33G006",
        "predicate": "[[wikilink]]",
        "props": [
          {
            "@id": "BlockNode:00CDDVC8N0004:links:Link:00CDDW6ZJG000:props:StringProp:00CDDW6ZJG001",
            "@type": "StringProp",
            "key": "position",
            "value": "260"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "title": "00CDEZBJKR004",
    "text": "**`kg:*` only runs from inside this source checkout.** Every command requires `npm run kg:X --` from `Aperas/web`, with `tsx` and the rest of the devDependencies installed — not something an end user installing a skill that shells out to `kg` can rely on. See [Motivation](../discussion/cli-packaging.md#id/BlockNode:00CDDVC33G006).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CDDVC8N0003",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CDDVC8N0005",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "links": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00CDDVC8N0005:links:Link:00CDDW6ZJR000",
        "@type": "Link",
        "target": "BlockNode:00CDDVC33G00A",
        "predicate": "[[wikilink]]",
        "props": [
          {
            "@id": "BlockNode:00CDDVC8N0005:links:Link:00CDDW6ZJR000:props:StringProp:00CDDW6ZJR001",
            "@type": "StringProp",
            "key": "position",
            "value": "234"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "title": "00CDEZBJKR005",
    "text": "**The graph's location is hardcoded.** `getArtifactsDir()` resolves `AperasKG/artifacts` as a fixed sibling of `web/` — true only for this repo's own layout, not for an installed CLI running against an arbitrary user's own graph. See [discussion](../discussion/cli-packaging.md#id/BlockNode:00CDDVC33G00A).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CDDVC8N0003",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CDDVC8N0006",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
