    ],
    "title": "## Implementation Plan",
    "text": "To be broken down once [the graph-location question](../issues/cli-packaging.md#id/BlockNode:00CDDVC8N0002) has an answer — [the dispatcher refactor itself](../design/cli-packaging.md#id/BlockNode:00CDDVBXHG005) doesn't depend on it, but shipping a usable package does.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CDDVCDW8001",
